* Fully differential two-stage OTA with continuous-time common-mode feedback.
* Model libraries are supplied by the testbench.
* Geometry values are in micrometres; wide devices use multiple fingers.
.subckt sampling_feedback_ota vss iref vdd vinn vinp vocm voutn voutp

* External reference and complementary bias distribution.
XNR iref iref vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1.5 w=12 nf=2
XBR pb iref vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1.5 w=12 nf=2
XPR pb pb vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=1 w=30 nf=2
XBT bn pb vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=1 w=30 nf=2
XNB bn bn vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1.5 w=24 nf=2
CBN iref vss 1p
CBP pb vdd 1p
CBT bn vss 1p

* Differential input stage with reduced-overdrive tail bias.
XTAIL tail bn vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1.5 w=384 nf=8
XIP xn vinp tail vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=2 w=400 nf=8
XIN xp vinn tail vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=2 w=400 nf=8
XLP xn pcm1 vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=3 w=360 nf=8
XLN xp pcm1 vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=3 w=360 nf=8

* First-stage common-mode sensing, with AC feed-forward.
RXP xp xcm 2meg
RXN xn xcm 2meg
CXP xp xcm 60f
CXN xn xcm 60f

* First-stage common-mode error amplifier.
* Increasing xcm raises pcm1 and reduces the PMOS load current.
XCT1 ct1 bn vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1.5 w=48 nf=4
XC11 cd1 xcm ct1 vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=0.5 w=100 nf=4
XC12 pcm1 iref ct1 vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=0.5 w=100 nf=4
XC13 cd1 cd1 vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.5 w=40 nf=4
XC14 pcm1 cd1 vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.5 w=40 nf=4
CCM1 pcm1 vdd 100f

* Long-channel common-source output stages.
XON voutn xp vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=3 w=576 nf=12
XOP voutp xn vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=3 w=576 nf=12
XPLN voutn pcm2 vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=3 w=1440 nf=16
XPLP voutp pcm2 vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=3 w=1440 nf=16

* Differential Miller compensation with series zero-nulling resistance.
RCP xn zcp 180
CCP zcp voutp 850f
RCN xp zcn 180
CCN zcn voutn 850f

* Output common-mode detector.
ROP voutp ocm 100k
RON voutn ocm 100k
COP voutp ocm 150f
CON voutn ocm 150f

* Output common-mode error amplifier.
* Increasing output average raises pcm2 and reduces output pull-up current.
XCT2 ct2 bn vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1.5 w=96 nf=4
XC21 cd2 ocm ct2 vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=0.5 w=200 nf=8
XC22 pcm2 vocm ct2 vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=0.5 w=200 nf=8
XC23 cd2 cd2 vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.5 w=80 nf=4
XC24 pcm2 cd2 vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.5 w=80 nf=4

* Symmetric output common-mode loop compensation.
CCMP pcm2 voutp 100f
CCMN pcm2 voutn 100f

.ends sampling_feedback_ota
